WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.620
Your car wash is busy.

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.620
But how often do you stop to answer: is my car ready?

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.020
And how many customers wash once,

4
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.140
then never come back?

5
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.820
Let’s use an example.

6
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.740
Twelve questions a day,

7
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.340
two minutes for each reply,

8
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.660
adds up to over ten hours a month.

9
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.740
And twenty potential washes,

10
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.740
at an average of forty-five riyals,

11
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.380
are nine hundred riyals in potential revenue.

12
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.607
Studies suggest that direct communication with customers

13
00:00:28.007 --> 00:00:29.687
may increase their likelihood of returning.

14
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.887
So your relationship continues after the wash.

15
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:34.900
With Muwalif,

16
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.220
the customer scans the code and sends a message.

17
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.740
The cashier sees their place in the queue,

18
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.340
and records the service and payment.

19
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.100
When the car is ready,

20
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.740
a ready notice and receipt link follow.

21
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:48.340
The owner can see recorded services and payments.

22
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:49.700
After the visit,

23
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.060
collect the customer’s feedback,

24
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.540
and prepare reminders with permission.

25
00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.420
Muwalif.

26
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.260
Keep every wash recorded.

27
00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.940
Register your interest in trying Muwalif for your car wash.
